{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中共總書記、國家主席習近平到了廣東中山考察，強調要奮力開創粵港澳大灣區高質量發展新局面。他又到訪孫中山故居紀念館。</p><p></p><p>中共總書記習近平這日先到訪深中通道西人工島，了解通道建設運營情況，指出要建設粵港澳大灣區，首先要推進交通一體化，要讓深中通道更好服務粵港澳大灣區建設。他之後到訪翠亨新區的灣區未來科技城，他強調建設粵港澳大灣區是中共中央作出的重大戰略部署，希望中山抓住機遇，推動高質量發展。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.XI.VISIT-1930_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pWPOY9p5eX1794831067.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>今年是孫中山先生誕辰160周年，習近平前往南朗街道的孫中山故居紀念館，向孫中山銅像敬獻花籃，又參觀展覽，察看故居保護情況。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.XI.VISIT-1930_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tvEoR2aMGO1794831109.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.XI.VISIT-1930_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cnuQipQ7dr1794831129.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>習近平指，要深入研究孫中山先生的生平和思想，講好孫中山先生的革命故事，教育引導幹部群眾，特別是青少年學習偉人風範、矢志愛國報國。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.XI.VISIT-1930_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Pp7zgP5IQC1794831093.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他又強調，做好歲末年初各項工作，推動經濟持續向新向優向好，實現「十五五」良好開局。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.XI.VISIT-1930.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026heNMtUgtbP1794830889.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:58:07.048271+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T12:51:27.613964+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:51:27.613964+00:00","content_hash":"c329a875a4f623c2d06efa13de1f65fc4c8ea8cbc23fa4fe0a5afc71e5219ca5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}